\textcolor{primaryblue}{\textbf{\faCheckCircle\ Divisibility Shortcut:}}

$\lfloor n/k \rfloor$ integers in $\{1,\ldots,n\}$ divisible by $k$.
For intersections use LCM: $|A_i\cap A_j| = \lfloor n/\text{lcm}(k_i,k_j)\rfloor$

