Sequences, Series \& Summations}}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{primaryblue}{\textbf{\faCheckCircle\ Sequence Closed Forms:}}
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{|l|l|l|}
\hline
\rowcolor{primaryblue!20}
\textbf{Type} & \textbf{Recurrence} & \textbf{Closed Form} \\
\hline
Arithmetic & $a_n = a_{n-1}+d$ & $a_n = a_0 + nd$ \\
\hline
Geometric  & $a_n = r\,a_{n-1}$ & $a_n = a_0 \cdot r^n$ \\
